  "journal.memoryechoes.page.1": "I once believed every tool was born empty.\n\nI was wrong.",
  "journal.memoryechoes.page.2": "Steel remembers.\n\nStone remembers.\n\nEven wood remembers.\n\nWe simply forgot how to listen.",
  "journal.memoryechoes.page.3": "Sometimes, after enough work...\n\nI hear them.\n\nNot voices.\n\nEchoes.",
  "journal.memoryechoes.page.4": "Hold the tool.\n\nStand still.\n\nQuiet your hands.\n\nThe past answers those willing to listen.",
  "journal.memoryechoes.page.5": "I feared replacing an old companion.\n\nSo I laid the new one upon the anvil, and set the old beside it.\n\nSteel may break.\n\nMemory does not.",
